WEBVTT

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.900
You should be paying attention to me!

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.410
Let's end this, once and for all.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:10.460
Pretty sure this isn't fair...

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.010
They're all being controlled by Wraith.

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:54.050
Then what are we supposed to do?

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.490
I... I can't move!

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:24.520
Are you saying that we've still 
underestimated their powers?

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.570
Sir...

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.530
We've received word from the Air Force.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.390
They've informed us that they're going forward...

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:32.100
They're scrambling?

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:34.130
Stop them, Clarence.

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:35.510
They're just there...

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:42.640
They're just there, and they'll eventually 
become a huge threat to us.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.680
The whole world is watching!

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.280
We knew this would happen.

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:11.440
You're in the way, you know? 
Of our dysfunctional relationship.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.050
Ow... That hurt, damn it.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.310
Not bad, man in black.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:34.890
But I've got something up my sleeve, too!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.990
Wasn't that some old guy and three brats?

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.810
Know why they ended up that way?

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:48.750
What?

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.630
I literally made their blood boil.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:10.970
I let it simmer, and simmer some more...

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:18.050
Their blood boiled, their veins burst, 
and their muscles exploded.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.700
Your suit might withstand this,

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.460
but I wonder what will happen on the inside.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.010
How do you like that?

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:34.480
Don't underestimate my power!

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.600
<i>Shining Flash!</i>

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:37.080
Huh?

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.090
Ow!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.770
H-Hey, my...

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.680
My little bats... What have you done?!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:05.740
Here we go.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.920
<i>Earth Shaker!</i>

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.750
<i>Wind Blaster!</i>

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.960
Let's dial things up a bit!

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.620
<i>Burning Flare!</i>

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:50.890
That was hot, damn it... How dare you...

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:52.540
How dare you?!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.250
<i>Ian, here it comes.</i>

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:20.010
I'll blow you away, just like 
I did your little friends!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.190
Don't you have any '80s songs?

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.030
Hey, he's saying something.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.700
I don't understand English, though.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:28.440
Guess they don't understand me.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:32.000
Then I guess I'll just have to sing!

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:44.820
<i>Identified the enemy's sound wave.</i>

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:46.060
Yeah.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.850
<i>Converting your energy with the suit.</i>

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.060
<i>Counterbalancing the enemy's wavelength.</i>

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.260
<i>Jay...</i>

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.740
<i>Head blaster lock has been released.</i>

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:56.940
<i>Tim...</i>

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:58.940
<i>Energy charge:</i>

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:02.480
<i>60. 75. 80.</i>

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:02.860
<i>Enrico...</i>

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:07.900
<i>85. 90. 91. 92.</i>

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.750
Those are their names!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.900
<i>Let him have it, Ian!</i>

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:36.140
I'm heading over there. 
What will you four do?

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:38.140
He's saying something again.

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:45.180
The old guy left.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:47.570
That robot's an old guy?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.630
What should we do?

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:50.660
What else?

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.800
We're heroes!

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:53.730
Yeah.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:57.120
There!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.240
<i>Lightning!</i>

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.170
That's a little girl, you know.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.140
Nice move. I'll be taking that.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.070
Lisa!

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.570
Big Wheel!

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.490
The darkness has peaked.

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:52.480
Locked on to the target.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:05.750
What the...

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:22.100
What was that?

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:32.910
Weren't you... Weren't you going 
to make this into our world?

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:37.020
I said this would be a world of Darkness.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:46.020
Now, reveal yourself to us, Darkness!

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:55.690
Michael!

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:00.180
Vy... It's you.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:03.780
Michael, I was always by your side.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:05.310
I know.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:08.490
I thought you could see the Reflected...

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.510
I can't see. I want to see you.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.080
I hate the dark...

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.330
Sayaka, make it brighter in here.

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:31.220
It's not working.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.690
What is this place?

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:36.780
My powers...

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:47.910
Hey, can I ask you something?

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.910
Why do you have to go this far?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.290
Humanity is finished.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.420
I will change their world 
into a world of Darkness.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.810
And what will happen to us?

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:10.270
We will become one with Darkness.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:12.880
What awaits there is nothingness 
as well as everything...

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:14.810
Zero and eternity.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.170
There will no longer be a 
need to fear the darkness

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.920
because it will protect you.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.770
You won't have to feel anymore.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:24.680
You will melt into the darkness, 
and you will refer to it as bliss!

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.480
That's why you did that to Eleanor?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.670
That's right. That's why I had her die.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.660
No... No!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.660
And my friends...

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:45.560
I told you... I made them a part of it.

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:49.270
You cannot use your powers in this darkness!

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:53.650
<i>Ian, your suit won't work 
without its power source.</i>

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.590
<i>Ian.</i>

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:09.210
Mister...

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:15.500
How dare you...

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.530
Everything is over.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:57.210
Mister!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.130
Did Eleanor truly accept

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:04.100
someone like you?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.050
Darkness...

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:22.910
Both Eleanor and X-On have 
become one with Darkness.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:25.090
You will soon follow them.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:25.940
Give up now!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:32.030
Eleanor was clumsy and would mess up 
sometimes, but she never gave up!

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:37.350
I could do nothing but hide, 
but she told me to fight.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.000
So until the end, I will...

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.320
No! I won't give up!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:59.220
Okay... I'll move forward.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:09.690
That's right... I will never close my eyes.

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:32.890
You didn't betray your friends.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:38.760
All of them died, except for one. 
That's the truth.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:42.080
But you didn't run away.

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:44.060
That's why you said it like that...

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.810
Sorry I couldn't communicate that better.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.350
I'm used to it by now.

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:04.830
Darkness!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:18.650
How? I got rid of you...

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.930
We were all with the darkness.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:57.160
We walked alongside darkness, and we've 
lived this long, making it our own.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:00.500
That's why we weren't 
tainted by your darkness.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.220
That's why we're strong.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:10.000
But you were crushed by the darkness, 
and then you took my hand...

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:14.560
Yes, I ended up surrendering to you.

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:18.270
But I can't hold on to you forever.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.360
Because... I'm the one who created Ethan.

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:27.960
I can't hold on to myself, nor can 
I make myself disappear on my own.

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:31.800
My darkness was my dead brother.

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:36.010
I've decided to live with my darkness.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:38.740
And if that's true, who are you?

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.310
Who?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:56.150
It's too late! This world 
will belong to Darkness!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:08.200
How did you get that power?

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.710
I think you have the wrong 
idea about something.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:13.550
I'm not a Reflected to begin with.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:14.840
What?

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:31.940
Big Wheel!

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.070
Vy!

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.200
No!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.200
I'll protect you.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:44.610
I'll protect you, too!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:57.820
Why?

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.300
I apparently grabbed hold of the wrong hand.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:03.680
You traitor!

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.560
What are you doing?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.580
Curse you...

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.410
Let's go.

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:21.950
Yeah!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.210
<i>Earth Shaker!</i>

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:33.730
<i>Shining Flash!</i>

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.060
<i>Wind Blaster!</i>

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.640
<i>Burning...</i>

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.110
<i>Flare.</i>

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.190
Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.820
Next is the real deal!

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:05.860
<i>Wind Shining Earth Flare!</i>

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:41.230
Why... Why won't you accept 
Darkness's darkness?!

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:45.280
The darkness that promises a perfect world!

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:52.090
This world already has plenty of darkness.

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:54.000
Right, Ian?

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:55.600
Yeah.

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:29.660
Eleanor!

00:22:42.530 --> 00:22:44.250
Mister, you're pretty awesome!

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:46.220
You're super good at singing.

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:47.780
Yeah, you're awesome!

00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:49.760
You'd be super popular 
if you put videos online!

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:52.260
I guess I didn't ask your names yet?

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:53.370
Huh?

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:56.150
I think he said something about names.

00:22:56.510 --> 00:22:58.290
We're...

00:22:58.290 --> 00:22:59.780
Ninth Wonder!

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:02.310
Ninth Wo...

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:04.020
Let's call you 9nine.

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:06.530
I have no idea what he's saying.

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:09.080
The name's Ian Izette.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:33.560
I... did something awful.

00:23:33.990 --> 00:23:35.570
It's not your fault.

00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:40.910
It was Darkness's power that created someone 
who shouldn't have even existed.

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:44.450
You were the only one who 
stood a chance against him.

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:47.090
And you defeated him. Am I wrong?

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:50.330
But so many lives were sacrificed.

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:56.330
You're the only one who can decide how 
you'll use the powers you were given.

00:23:58.600 --> 00:24:00.900
I'm the one who has to decide...

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:07.900
Even if this world has darkness, 
the dawn will always come.

00:24:08.780 --> 00:24:09.690
It's beautiful.

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:14.680
I guess looking for the light within 
the darkness suits me more.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:17.880
You're right. The world is filled with light.

00:24:17.880 --> 00:24:19.300
That's not exactly right.

00:24:19.300 --> 00:24:22.360
It's the same thing. There's light 
within the darkness.

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:25.170
That's what I thought when 
I was in everyone's hearts.

00:24:25.170 --> 00:24:27.980
Darkness is darkness, and light is light.

00:24:28.310 --> 00:24:29.700
So it's the same, isn't it?

00:24:29.700 --> 00:24:31.370
No, it's not.

00:24:31.810 --> 00:24:32.860
X-On!

00:24:50.210 --> 00:24:51.480
That's...
